title: "T1D-CVD risk calculators: reproducible in-silico discordance analysis and an open multi-tool meta-calculator"
abstract: "Open re-implementations of published cardiovascular risk calculators relevant to type 1 diabetes, a seeded synthetic-cohort discordance analysis, and a transparent browser meta-calculator."
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-06-13
